.0s linear infinite"><div class="r3-h"><span>Company</span><span>Size</span><span>Fit</span></div><div class="r3-hl r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia2 24.0s linear infinite"><span>Northwind · best fit</span><span>320 seats</span><span>Hot</span></div><div class="r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia3 24.0s linear infinite"><span>Acme Retail</span><span>80 seats</span><span>Warm</span></div><div class="r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia4 24.0s linear infinite"><span>Bloom Studio</span><span>6 seats</span><span>Later</span></div></div><p class="r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia6 24.0s linear infinite">I added all three to <b>HubSpot</b> with their scores and posted the hot lead in <b>#sales</b>.</p></div><div class="r3-hx-t2"><div class="r3-ap-user r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia34 24.0s linear infinite"><p>Book a call with Northwind and send Sam a short brief.</p></div><div class="r3-ap-worked r3-hx-wk r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia35 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-hx-working r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia36 24.0s linear infinite"><em class="r3-hx-shim">Working…</em></span><span class="r3-hx-worked r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia37 24.0s linear infinite">Worked for 21s <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div><div class="r3-ap-tl r3-hx-tl"><div class="r3-ap-step r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia25 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-ap-node"><span class="r3-hx-spin r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia26 24.0s linear infinite"><i></i></span><span class="r3-hx-ic r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia27 24.0s linear infinite"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg></span></span><span class="r3-ap-st">Found <b>a free slot on Tuesday at 14:00</b></span><span class="r3-ap-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div><div class="r3-ap-step r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia28 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-ap-node"><span class="r3-hx-spin r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia29 24.0s linear infinite"><i></i></span><span class="r3-hx-ic r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia30 24.0s linear infinite"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"></path></svg></span></span><span class="r3-ap-st">Sent <b>the invite to Dana at Northwind</b></span><span class="r3-ap-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div><div class="r3-ap-step r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia31 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-ap-node"><span class="r3-hx-spin r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia32 24.0s linear infinite"><i></i></span><span class="r3-hx-ic r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia33 24.0s linear infinite"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4z"></path><path d="M22 2 11 13"></path></svg></span></span><span class="r3-ap-st">Posted <b>a brief for Sam in #sales</b></span><span class="r3-ap-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" s